		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Teal, serpentine heralds of entropy, dwellers of Limbo. Macaw-headed snake-beings of utter Chaos. Fickle.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 33, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +6 (2d6) or warpwave, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Being of Chaos</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources. Immune to acid.</p><p></p><p><strong>Warpwave</strong>. All beings within near of protean (including protean), CHA 15+ or take 1d8 attribute damage. d6: 1. STR, 2. DEX, 3. CON, 4. INT, 5. WIS, 6. CHA.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
